file tools/hooks/pre-commit rule nine asks that reading of the commit's own set, so a marker refuses its author rather than the next lap's open
file tools/fixtures/c/conflict_marker_control.sh twelve staged legs and two that arm the real hook in a pen, every refusal lifted from both sides
